      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6701/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, cinnamon, salt, nuts, and raisins in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T_Gb7yW5fS2apyxwe87vJ30uFUI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-6701-persimmon-bread-VAT-step-02-4102b631274f464ea4a327f51fec8465.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6701/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend eggs, sugar, and oil in a large bowl. Stir baking soda into persimmon pulp until well blended; add to sugar mixture.",
